# Commits go to main

Commit work directly to `main` and push to `origin/main`.

- Do not create feature branches for this repository.
- Do not open pull requests for routine changes.
- Before committing, check out `main` and bring it up to date with `git pull --ff-only origin main`.
- Still follow `commit-settings-sqlite.mdc` when staging.
